-- End definitions from CSR.clean


Text:
  Checked supporting results.
  We restate the two zero-case statements in Foundations.clean. Verified.lean proves them
  and five agreement lemmas. These are not the four numbered paper theorems.
Result no accumulated rounding at zero:
  Attribution: laproof; equation 4; adapted
  Let u: Real
  Conclude: accumulated rounding(u,0) = 0

Result no accumulated underflow at zero:
  Attribution: laproof; equation 5; adapted
  Let u,eta: Real
  Let m: Natural
  Conclude: accumulated underflow(u,eta,0,m) = 0



